## Initial Q&A
### Did Taylor Zundel post a video on Instagram on or around October 27, 2020, claiming that she and other early voters in Utah were told they had already voted?
Answer: Yes, the search result confirms this. According to the archived article from Herman Cain's website, Taylor Zundel shared her experience on Instagram, explaining that she and her husband live in or near Salt Lake City, Utah, and when they showed up for early voting, "Not just her husband, but at least one other voter, were told when they got there that records showed they had already voted." The article's discussion of the incident is consistent with a video posted around the claim date of October 27, 2020.

